Package: regextable
Title: Pattern-Based Text Extraction and Standardization with Lookup Tables
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Shirlyn", "Dong", email = "shirlynd@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Devin", "Judge-Lord", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: Extracts information from text using lookup tables of regular
    expressions. Each text entry is matched against patterns in a
    specified order, and the first matching pattern and substring are
    returned. Matching avoids re-checking patterns for entries that have
    already been matched, improving performance when large pattern sets
    are used.
